# Write a CFO email and an operations update — learner brief

Fictional Northstar Services training material.

## Approved fictional facts
F1 September budget USD 200,000.
F2 actual USD 218,000; supplied variance USD 18,000 / 9%.
F3 approved explanation USD 12,000 contractor extension and USD 6,000 travel.
F4 forecast revision proposed, unapproved.
F5 operations lead must confirm remaining contractor end date by September 25.


## Task

Northstar's September cost review is complete. The same approved facts need two internal drafts.

## Actions


1. Write the reader and requested action for each version.
2. Give F1–F5 to AI and request both drafts with different emphasis.
3. Check every number, date, and approval-status verb against the facts.
4. Revise the CFO version to foreground impact and decision status, and the operations version to foreground the date confirmation.
5. Record two edits that improved usefulness without changing meaning.


## Output
Audience briefs; CFO email up to 180 words; operations update up to 90 words; fact ledger; revision note.
